1️⃣ BRD – Business Requirement Document

Project Name: PhonePe Business Performance Analysis

Business Objective

To improve overall business efficiency and customer experience by analyzing transaction performance, failure reasons, seasonal trends, and revenue dependency across PhonePe services.

Business Problem

High dependency on Loan services for revenue

Frequent transaction failures due to system and customer errors

Lack of visibility into service-wise and seasonal performance

Stakeholders

Business Team

Product Managers

Operations Team

Technology Team

Data Analytics Team

High-Level Business Requirements

Identify revenue contribution by each service

Analyze transaction success vs failure

Detect major failure reasons

Identify seasonal and monthly trends

Provide actionable recommendations

Success Metrics

Reduction in transaction failure rate

Improved service adoption beyond Loans

Better preparedness during peak seasons
